WEBVTT

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:50.980
The singularity of the third figures in this museum

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:54.530
lies in the secret procedure with which I create them.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:58.890
As representative figure of the unreal world of the screen,

00:03:59.230 --> 00:03:59.970
I chose to create them myself.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.460
the undisputed personality of an actor who has filled the two eras of

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:10.830
cinematography gary cooper the famous american star gandhi the head of the

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:14.650
hindu nationalist movement who took care of the moral and civil education of

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.950
young people recommending the renunciation of violence to achieve

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:23.090
freedom of his country jose stalin even today the world suffers the

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:27.710
consequences of his amazing ability to create the political and military power

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:29.880
that puts the peace of the world in danger.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:44.890
This figure that you are seeing represents Guillotin, the inventor of the guillotine, and as a macabre paradox, the first justice in his own invention.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:59.970
Francisco Villa, the famous Centaur of the North, whose discussion...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.480
This personality marked a time in the history of the Mexican Revolution.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:12.890
This is one of the crime geniuses, Landru, the man who fell in love with women to murder them.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:18.080
Without a doubt, he was a diabolical being, but of an undeniable personality,

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:22.520
and possessing a strange attraction for female sex.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:29.670
Now, if you like to accompany me, we will go down to another very interesting gallery of museums.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:36.090
Dr. Ricardo?

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:37.450
At your service.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.470
I'm sorry to interrupt you, but...

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:40.840
No, you continue.

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:43.840
I'm Susana Mendoza, photographer for the editorial La Grande.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:47.880
I need to take some plates of your wax figures for a report that you are going to publish.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.600
I'm at your service.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:52.080
Would you like to accompany us to the galleries downstairs?

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:52.900
Yes, doctor.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:55.860
Precisely, that is the section of your museum that interests me the most.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.360
Over here, then.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:01.420
Follow me, please.

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:45.040
because I have reduced the most famous monsters in history

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:49.300
due to the creation of the diabolically human

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:12.440
This is Mr. Hyde, a monstrous cure in which Dr. Jekyll was transformed

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:15.050
by means of a possum that he himself had discovered.

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:20.390
In this way, the monster that was latent within him was brought to life,

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:23.550
and that is surely within every human being.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:40.880
Here you have the monster created by Dr. Frankenstein.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.580
You see how far science can go.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.020
Man creating man's aberration.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:51.270
Made with human remains, with fragments of corpses.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.750
Now you are seeing the bloodthirsty beast.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:13.220
This is the savage form that the seventh son of a man took in the periods of full moon,

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:20.210
because the first of the dynasty had been bitten in the mountains of Tibet by the abominable man of the snows.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.320
Can I start taking pictures?

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.630
The ones you want, miss. Follow me, please.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:53.450
This is Quasimodo, the monstrous

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.380
Is there anything I can do for you, miss?

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:04.500
No, thank you.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.000
I just want to tell you that this work will take several days.

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:07.840
I understand.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:11.200
The current collection consists of thirty-one figures.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.930
I plan to come several times in the afternoon, if you allow me.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.850
Besides, I have to ask you for information.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.880
Oh, are you going to write the report yourself?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.660
No, I'm just a photographer.

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.670
It will be written by Ricardo Carvajal, an extraordinary journalist.

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:26.260
Do you talk about him with great enthusiasm?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.090
Is he your boyfriend?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.790
No, doctor, but...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.840
The fool will be from the family, he will marry my sister.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:02.870
The more they go, the better they get married, huh?

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.030
But I hope it's soon.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.230
Oh, if we're waiting for you to have a boyfriend,

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:08.780
why don't we get married together?

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:10.400
And so we can save ourselves a little party.

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.760
Well, don't worry about me, I've already found my destiny.

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:13.700
Isn't it pretty?

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.260
And this one doesn't look very good on me.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.920
So you've already been to the museum?

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:18.460
Yes, take a picture of it.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.620
I'll have to go several times, but I'll give you good material for your report.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.180
Did they put obstacles on you?

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:25.840
None. Dr. Carlos is a very nice man.

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:29.720
Ah, dear professor, I beat him again.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:43.080
You won me for 148 points.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:48.400
I have to admit that you are superior to me, Dr. Carl.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.480
You play with wisdom and I with tactics.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:55.110
Don't trust yourself, because sometimes chance intervenes...

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:58.930
...and breaks the best of tactics.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.390
It's been a long time since you've come to the museum.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:08.340
I have some new figures and I'd like you to see them. Thank you.

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:09.960
Any historical figures?

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.220
No, that no longer interests people.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:15.800
What now draws a lot of attention is the monster gallery.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:19.610
I assure you that my deformed creatures seem to have a magnet.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:20.830
They are the ones I like the most.

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:32.710
Give me a moment.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:59.390
Thank you very much.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.880
Mission accomplished, Professor Galván.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:03.100
What happened?

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:07.520
The death due to poisoning of his colleague, Professor Ruanova,

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:09.340
was neither suicide nor an accident.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:13.260
It was a crime for revenge committed by some foreign agents

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:14.780
who are already in the hands of the police.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:17.340
Huh? That's what I thought.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.820
You don't know how much I thank you, Santo.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.170
You don't have to thank me for anything, Professor.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:25.220
You know you can count on me whenever you need me.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:33.670
Who is that man?

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:38.110
He is a strange man, one of those who no longer exist in this world.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:41.030
I thought I heard that he was called Saint.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:42.240
Yes, Doctor.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:45.540
He is the legendary silver masked man.

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:54.340
More than a famous fighter, he is an tireless ally of justice to fight evil and crime.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.070
I thought there were no men like that anymore.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:59.970
And tell me, Professor, do you know...

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:03.380
I have never seen your face.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.040
Your identity is an incognito.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.120
But anyone who fights for a noble cause

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.570
will have a friend in the Holy.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:01.410
Thank you.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:31.800
You

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:06.190
I scared her.

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.230
Frankly, yes, doctor.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.280
You don't know how much I'm sorry.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.410
It's my fault. I'm a fool.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:19.040
I asked you to come later today because,

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.940
if no one bothers us, I can take care of her better.

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:23.540
I thank you very much, doctor.

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:25.580
I'm at your service.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:28.270
Ask all the information you need.

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:29.930
Since you are so kind, yes.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.380
and keep explaining to me about the other figures.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:36.130
But did they really exist, or is it pure fantasy?

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.760
Fantasy is the daughter of reality, Miss Susana.

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.670
I think that everything invented by imagination

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.880
has existed or will exist.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.410
The Phantom of the Opera, right?

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:50.150
Exactly.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:54.000
Do you know the story of your love for a singer

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:58.620
who rapes you by taking you through the dark corridors of the theater?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.940
Tell me, Doctor, what idea drove you to collect this gallery of monsters?

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:10.510
Man is the only rational animal created in the image and likeness of God.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:19.080
This gallery reminds us that in the human species there are beings that are much more abominable and wild than the worst animals.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:24.150
Monsters are not only in the physical, but also in the mental.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:28.740
It has taken me ten years of my life to create this gallery.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:35.160
I've had to investigate, study, collect data, legends, testimonies,

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:38.540
to get an exact fidelity in these figures.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.500
Do you feel very proud?

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:44.400
Frankly, yes, Miss Susana.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:47.560
I noticed something curious, Doctor.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:49.750
Why is there no female monster?

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:51.020
Yes, there is.

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.890
Although it is not of those who have acquired greater popularity,

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:58.430
among my projects I have planned to make the figure of the Panther Woman.

00:17:58.590 --> 00:17:59.670
And I already have everything.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.000
for the documentation.

00:18:01.852 --> 00:18:03.012
The panther woman.

00:18:03.548 --> 00:18:05.308
I think it's disgusting.

00:18:05.948 --> 00:18:06.948
I don't see why.

00:18:07.388 --> 00:18:09.388
My figures are only of wax.

00:18:10.588 --> 00:18:12.928
If the man could show in his face...

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:15.020
the monstrosity of his soul.

00:18:15.932 --> 00:18:19.532
I assure you it would be more deformed than any of these beings.

00:18:20.412 --> 00:18:22.412
What inspires you to create your figures?

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.400
in the hidden human passions.

00:18:25.916 --> 00:18:28.916
in man himself without his mask of falsehood.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.830
I would like to visit my laboratory.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.000
Maybe another day.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:38.020
I assure you that you will be passionate to see how I create these characters,

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:44.660
how I mold the face, how they make the gesture, the rite of cruelty.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:46.390
I'm worried about you at the same time.

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.430
It's too late and I have to go.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.570
They're waiting for me at home.

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:56.490
It'll only take a minute.

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.990
I'll feel honored for your visit.

00:19:00.188 --> 00:19:01.268
Maybe some other day.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:02.340
I promise.

00:19:02.396 --> 00:19:04.396
See you tomorrow!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:29.460
Diana Mendoza, street 2, number 7

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:30.840
San Angel.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:38.410
What are you going to do?

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:39.420
Call the museum.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.400
It's a silly worry of ours.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:44.600
Maybe he just took pictures.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.920
Yes, is this Dr. Carroll?

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.020
Mrs. Mendoza?

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:09.490
Yes, of course she was here, but she left a long time ago.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:13.470
I don't know, I guess she went to the house.

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:14.570
She didn't tell me where she was going.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:15.620
Who's this?

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:17.720
Ricardo Carvajal.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:21.080
I'm with Gloria, Mrs. Susana's sister.

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:22.960
And since we're worried about your delay,

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.680
that's why I dared to call you.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.610
Yes, doctor. I understand.

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:32.100
Good. Thank you, and forgive the inconvenience.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:36.160
He says he left the museum a while ago.

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.700
If he had gone somewhere else, he would have called us by phone, right?

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.780
I left him a message in the newspaper. He hasn't called back.

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:43.800
There he is!

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:50.910
Mrs. Mendoza?

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:51.290
Yes.

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:53.710
Ah, calm down.

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:56.680
She must have been worried about her room.

00:21:57.690 --> 00:21:59.850
When she left the Rosary, I found her in the...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.720
in front of the church of Coyoacan.

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:05.510
And luckily, it had its name and address.

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:11.490
This is my sister's room.

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.350
But how is it possible that she lost it?

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:17.860
Thank you, ma'am. You're very kind.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:20.040
No, young man, not at all.

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:24.890
I'm sure you would have done the same if I had lost something.

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:26.640
Good night.

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:28.460
Good night and thank you.

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:28.900
Good night.

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:39.990
We're going to call the police.

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:42.550
It was the first time your sister went to the wax museum.

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:46.520
No, she's doing a job for a magazine, and she had to take a lot of pictures.

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:51.220
Listen, Commissioner, don't you remember the last two disappearances?

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:56.450
Yes, a young law student and an office boy.

00:22:56.970 --> 00:22:57.410
Exactly.

00:22:58.150 --> 00:22:59.980
They coincide in the fact that those two people...

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.540
had also visited the museum.

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:04.870
But Dr. Carroll told us when we interrogated him

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:06.470
that he didn't remember having seen them.

00:23:06.930 --> 00:23:11.010
I think it would be convenient for a new visit to Dr. Carroll.

00:23:11.940 --> 00:23:14.820
Inspector Fernandez, take care of the investigation.

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:19.230
Yes, sir. Miss Susana has been here,

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:21.970
but she left at eight o'clock.

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:23.910
Don't you find it strange, Dr. Carroll,

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.380
that the three people who have disappeared have visited your museum?

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:29.920
Oh, that's the only thing...

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:33.290
Your proof is that the assailant, or the gang of assailants,

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:34.630
is acting in this direction.

00:23:34.790 --> 00:23:37.320
Inspector, do you think those disappearances

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:39.960
correspond to the same cell phone and the same authors?

00:23:40.240 --> 00:23:41.640
It could be.

00:23:41.960 --> 00:23:45.700
As well as it could be that someone is trying to harm me.

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:47.980
Anyway, Dr. Carroll,

00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:50.960
we would like to ask you a broader question.

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:53.160
I am at your service.

00:23:53.980 --> 00:23:56.180
I would ask you to go to the police station tomorrow.

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:57.000
I will be there.

00:23:57.180 --> 00:23:59.730
I am the first interested in making this mystery clear.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:01.180
Good evening.

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:04.970
Good evening.

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:05.410
Miss.

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:21.160
After the interrogation that the commissioner and the inspector

00:24:21.160 --> 00:24:24.200
submitted me to, I realize that they are unjustly suspecting me

00:24:24.200 --> 00:24:27.790
and that the author of those rapes is undoubtedly an enemy of mine.

00:24:28.010 --> 00:24:29.110
Do you have enemies, doctor?

00:24:29.450 --> 00:24:29.830
For life.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.680
Do you know who it could be?

00:24:31.820 --> 00:24:33.340
No, I have no idea.

00:24:33.820 --> 00:24:35.200
And that's what angers me.

00:24:35.380 --> 00:24:38.070
The feeling that I'm threatened by someone I don't know.

00:24:39.080 --> 00:24:40.940
That's why I came to ask for your help.

00:24:41.200 --> 00:24:41.880
Help me?

00:24:42.340 --> 00:24:44.400
You told me about Santo. He's your friend.

00:24:45.030 --> 00:24:48.490
And since it's a man who defends just causes,

00:24:48.650 --> 00:24:51.130
I thought you could intercede against him to...

00:24:51.130 --> 00:24:52.570
Danny, not a word more, Doctor.

00:24:52.810 --> 00:24:54.270
I'm going to communicate right now.

00:24:54.330 --> 00:24:57.130
Through this electronic locator,

00:24:57.130 --> 00:24:59.580
I can locate Santo wherever he is.

00:25:16.350 --> 00:25:17.210
You have to wait for it to finish.

00:25:17.530 --> 00:25:19.940
Then I'll tell him to go see you at the museum.

00:25:20.280 --> 00:25:21.640
I appreciate it very much, Professor.

00:31:02.520 --> 00:31:06.480
The absurd thing is that I'm asking you for your help against an invisible, anonymous enemy.

00:31:07.290 --> 00:31:10.770
If it's a recommendation from Professor Galvan, I'll gladly help you.

00:31:11.570 --> 00:31:16.370
But are you sure that what you've told me is a premeditated plan against you?

00:31:16.610 --> 00:31:18.960
Or maybe it's just a coincidence?

00:31:21.570 --> 00:31:22.710
I couldn't be sure.

00:31:23.190 --> 00:31:26.940
But as long as we don't find out who the perpetrators of those rapes are,

00:31:27.060 --> 00:31:28.460
the police will keep bothering us.

00:32:31.244 --> 00:32:31.524
Thank you.

00:33:54.030 --> 00:33:55.090
You are the sender of someone.

00:33:55.730 --> 00:33:59.270
Someone who proves to me that they are actually attacking my life.

00:34:00.060 --> 00:34:03.340
That's right. This dagger failed him for a short time.

00:34:03.400 --> 00:34:07.960
But at least it was useful to warn him that he must be alert to being repeated.

00:34:08.260 --> 00:34:09.890
What should I do?

00:34:10.220 --> 00:34:12.420
Be warned. The rest is up to me.

00:34:12.780 --> 00:34:14.850
I trust you, Santo, and thank you.

00:34:15.130 --> 00:34:16.050
You will have my news.

00:35:45.900 --> 00:35:47.000
Are you Susana's sister?

00:35:47.040 --> 00:35:47.300
Yes.

00:35:47.640 --> 00:35:48.260
And you?

00:35:49.110 --> 00:35:49.830
Ricardo Carvajal.

00:35:49.890 --> 00:35:53.180
Excuse me, but I didn't know who you could be.

00:35:53.440 --> 00:35:54.540
What are you looking for here?

00:35:54.720 --> 00:35:56.320
Why have you named my sister?

00:35:56.520 --> 00:35:57.590
Do you know anything about her?

00:35:57.900 --> 00:35:58.620
Nothing yet.

00:35:58.800 --> 00:35:59.520
That's why I came.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.240
to try to find out something else.

00:36:01.690 --> 00:36:03.790
But it wasn't necessary to go into the department.

00:36:04.150 --> 00:36:07.680
I didn't want anyone to know that I was in charge of the case.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:11.920
I tried to keep it a secret because that makes my job easier.

00:36:12.490 --> 00:36:14.620
And tell me, why is our help intervening?

00:36:14.720 --> 00:36:17.410
On behalf of someone interested in the matter.

00:36:17.670 --> 00:36:19.340
And do you have any clue yet?

00:36:19.440 --> 00:36:19.880
Not yet.

00:36:21.340 --> 00:36:24.040
Do you know that the police suspect Dr. Carlos,

00:36:25.500 --> 00:36:26.920
the owner of the wax museum?

00:36:27.120 --> 00:36:27.740
Yes, I know.

00:36:28.650 --> 00:36:29.930
And if you allow me a personal opinion...

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:31.700
I don't think they're wrong.

00:36:32.200 --> 00:36:33.430
Why do you think that?

00:36:34.320 --> 00:36:40.250
Because the police have told me that Dr. Carl was an eminent European surgeon

00:36:40.250 --> 00:36:44.390
who, after the World War, was released from the Auschwitz concentration camp

00:36:44.390 --> 00:36:46.140
and emigrated to the United States.

00:36:46.260 --> 00:36:50.230
Years later, he exploded an Alambique, burning it with acid.

00:36:51.680 --> 00:36:53.980
This accident was reported in the newspapers of the time.

00:36:54.220 --> 00:36:57.860
Do you know how serious the accident was?

00:36:57.960 --> 00:36:58.300
No.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:01.820
I know that he was admitted to a hospital,

00:37:01.980 --> 00:37:05.240
from which he escaped, losing all trace of his life.

00:37:06.100 --> 00:37:09.360
Three years later, a doctor appears in Mexico, Kurt Walter Carroll,

00:37:10.220 --> 00:37:11.560
inaugurating his wax museum.

00:37:12.370 --> 00:37:14.810
Those data do not prove anything against Dr. Carroll.

00:37:17.570 --> 00:37:19.370
The medical part of the American hospital

00:37:19.370 --> 00:37:22.110
says that his face was horribly burned by the acids.

00:37:22.450 --> 00:37:24.680
And the face of Dr. Carroll that we know

00:37:24.680 --> 00:37:26.420
has no trace of such an accident.

00:37:26.600 --> 00:37:28.620
Do you suspect that he is not the real doctor?

00:37:29.020 --> 00:37:29.240
Exactly.

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:33.880
Someone has replaced his personality, a maniac, a murderer, a madman.

00:37:33.940 --> 00:37:39.060
To dissuade him from suspicions about Dr. Carol, I must inform him that he called me to his aid.

00:37:39.280 --> 00:37:43.260
He is known to be threatened by an unknown enemy, and I have the proof.

00:37:43.690 --> 00:37:45.750
They tried to murder him in front of me.

00:37:46.930 --> 00:37:52.000
Anyway, I have requested a secret service a photograph of him, so we can identify him.

00:37:52.640 --> 00:37:55.410
I want to tell him that his intervention has given me new hopes.

00:37:55.830 --> 00:37:59.360
That he counts on us in everything we can help him.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:02.660
Thank you. At the moment I would like to take what I came to look for.

00:38:02.880 --> 00:38:04.600
The camera of your sister.

00:38:04.740 --> 00:38:08.240
I know that the police told her that a person found her and brought her.

00:38:08.980 --> 00:38:12.060
Yes, but we are left to hand over to the commissioner to look for fingerprints.

00:38:12.720 --> 00:38:15.060
And reveal the plates that are still in the camera.

00:38:15.720 --> 00:38:19.680
I will do the tests in my laboratory and then I will pass the reports to the police.

00:38:21.270 --> 00:38:29.530
Yes, here it is.

00:38:30.670 --> 00:38:35.110
I don't know if I can help you, but I have this photograph that Susana took the day before at the museum.

00:38:35.250 --> 00:38:37.770
Thank you.

00:38:37.770 --> 00:38:41.930
Anyway, I will try to find out to what extent your suspicions are true.

00:38:41.990 --> 00:38:43.710
I will continue to make people disappear.

00:38:44.370 --> 00:38:47.140
And if necessary, I will turn the museum into flames.

00:38:49.260 --> 00:38:51.400
That's what this anonymous says, as you can see.

00:38:55.760 --> 00:38:57.060
I would like to examine it closely.

00:39:00.600 --> 00:39:03.860
But what has this madman done with all the people who have disappeared?

00:39:04.260 --> 00:39:06.030
Will he be able to kill them?

00:39:06.760 --> 00:39:08.960
Everything can be expected of an abnormal being.

00:39:09.100 --> 00:39:12.140
And I also fear for my museum, my work of so many years,

00:39:12.200 --> 00:39:13.260
threatens to burn it.

00:39:13.620 --> 00:39:15.160
But don't you remember any enemy?

00:39:15.850 --> 00:39:18.670
Someone who tries to harm, who wants to take revenge?

00:39:18.990 --> 00:39:20.180
Not really.

00:39:20.720 --> 00:39:29.750
Not being in Europe during the war, I was...

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:36.510
a concentration camp. Fear can lead a man to desperate extremes.

00:39:36.530 --> 00:39:48.360
On a certain occasion, to save my life, I reported a group of compatriots. I hope this

00:39:48.360 --> 00:39:52.720
confession does not provoke your contempt. My remorse for all my life is enough

00:39:53.300 --> 00:39:59.970
punishment. Don't you think any of them is trying to take revenge? And why would there be

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:06.200
to wait so many years has not stopped chasing me not even a moment in the year 50 when I was

00:40:06.200 --> 00:40:11.740
in the United States I was the victim of an attack someone changed the acids in my laboratory and

00:40:12.370 --> 00:40:19.990
making the mixture caused a terrible explosion because he had never told me that he would have

00:40:19.990 --> 00:40:26.040
had to tell him also the background and no one likes to confess his crimes and

00:40:26.320 --> 00:40:29.320
how is it possible that this accident has not left any way

00:40:30.920 --> 00:40:33.040
What do you think, that I always wear them covered?

00:40:33.620 --> 00:40:36.770
I managed to cover my face with my hands.

00:40:36.970 --> 00:40:38.800
I couldn't prevent this.

00:41:30.510 --> 00:41:38.500
My sister can do it.

00:42:00.250 --> 00:42:07.180
Santo, if you need me, I went to look for Dr. Carola at her museum to attend a conference at the ateneo.

00:42:07.200 --> 00:42:12.850
I'm going to look for him.

00:42:23.020 --> 00:42:26.920
Victims, the figure of Jack the Stripper looks more complete, don't you think?

00:42:27.390 --> 00:42:27.870
Yes, doctor.

00:42:28.900 --> 00:42:29.660
Pintanella, blood.

00:42:57.670 --> 00:42:59.550
...but it's urgent.

00:43:00.120 --> 00:43:01.340
Have you seen Professor Galván?

00:43:01.480 --> 00:43:01.820
No.

00:43:02.350 --> 00:43:03.320
Is something wrong?

00:43:03.980 --> 00:43:07.200
He's not at home and I need to see him to clarify something important.

00:43:07.560 --> 00:43:11.880
He called me on the phone about an hour ago to invite me to a conference in the ateneo.

00:43:11.900 --> 00:43:14.420
He told me he would come to pick me up and I'm waiting for him.

00:43:14.420 --> 00:43:16.710
It's strange that it takes so long.

00:43:17.470 --> 00:43:18.930
However, he left a while ago.

00:43:19.650 --> 00:43:21.130
Don't you want to wait for him?

00:43:21.390 --> 00:43:23.620
Thank you, I can't. I have to go to the arena.

00:46:01.950 --> 00:46:02.110
Thank you.

00:47:01.760 --> 00:47:02.000
Thank you.

00:47:34.920 --> 00:47:35.300
Thank you.

00:48:16.890 --> 00:48:18.540
Professor, I'll do it myself.

00:48:30.990 --> 00:48:33.840
Why did you do this to me?

00:48:34.490 --> 00:48:38.460
It was necessary, and I assure you that I am sorry.

00:48:39.290 --> 00:48:42.050
You are my friend, professor, perhaps the only one.

00:48:42.190 --> 00:48:45.780
And believe me, I regret having to turn you into my victim.

00:48:49.440 --> 00:48:50.680
What's wrong with you, doctor?

00:48:51.080 --> 00:48:54.100
I just have to fulfill a plan.

00:48:55.070 --> 00:48:56.910
That's why I wrote the anonymous in your paper,

00:48:57.130 --> 00:48:59.830
so that they would believe that you were the culprit of everything.

00:49:00.920 --> 00:49:04.680
I didn't make it so obvious that it could be discovered easily.

00:49:05.280 --> 00:49:06.820
And Santo fell into the trap.

00:49:07.700 --> 00:49:10.620
Now I can't let you carry on with the investigation.

00:49:11.100 --> 00:49:12.880
You need to disappear.

00:49:13.520 --> 00:49:17.000
That way they'll think the culprit fled before being discovered.

00:49:18.960 --> 00:49:19.680
You're the murderer.

00:49:21.480 --> 00:49:23.360
I wouldn't use that word.

00:49:24.200 --> 00:49:26.580
Then why did you ask for Santo's help?

00:49:27.320 --> 00:49:28.900
To avoid the police's suspicions.

00:49:30.510 --> 00:49:33.310
the easy way to complete my work.

00:49:33.410 --> 00:49:34.070
Your work?

00:49:34.210 --> 00:49:34.670
Yes, professor.

00:49:35.480 --> 00:49:38.540
I am a superior being who is creating his own world,

00:49:38.780 --> 00:49:40.660
destroying what should not exist,

00:49:41.060 --> 00:49:43.280
creating my own creatures.

00:49:43.580 --> 00:49:44.360
You are crazy.

00:49:44.720 --> 00:49:46.840
Whoever tries to destroy the work of God

00:49:46.840 --> 00:49:48.260
ends up destroying himself.

00:49:48.780 --> 00:49:51.320
It may be, but I will reach the end

00:49:51.320 --> 00:49:53.620
without allowing obstacles in my way.

00:50:04.740 --> 00:50:12.310
What can I do to make it disappear and leave no trace?

00:50:44.330 --> 00:50:44.650
muchacha.

00:51:06.570 --> 00:51:06.750
Thank you.

00:51:52.840 --> 00:51:56.660
Soft as a petal, soon it will be rough, cracked.

00:52:00.410 --> 00:52:06.900
A mouth so perfect that it will become a deformed, cruel mucus.

00:52:27.720 --> 00:52:28.260
It's time.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:29.980
Thank you.

00:54:35.500 --> 00:54:39.090
Yes? Yes, Santo. I'm listening.

00:54:40.500 --> 00:54:42.920
I'm in the office of Professor Armando Galván.

00:54:43.000 --> 00:54:46.040
I have waited all night for your return.

00:54:46.300 --> 00:54:50.640
I am sure that your disappearance is linked to the other cases.

00:54:50.960 --> 00:54:53.690
They wanted to make me suspect the Professor.

00:54:54.010 --> 00:54:57.350
But I know him too well to have any doubt about him.

00:54:57.480 --> 00:54:58.600
And I fear for his life.

00:55:01.790 --> 00:55:05.210
I'm going to order the patrols to come out immediately in search of you.

00:55:06.030 --> 00:55:07.310
I want to ask you for something else, Commissioner.

00:55:07.770 --> 00:55:12.090
Make a new record in the wax museum and immediately close it.

00:55:13.200 --> 00:55:15.980
Don't let Dr. Carroll know that I've talked to you.

00:55:16.220 --> 00:55:26.400
You're my best friend. Do you want to make me suspicious?

00:55:26.960 --> 00:55:29.220
This record is nothing more than a process.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:34.020
And since Professor Galván was your friend, I imagine we have you to investigate your disappearance.

00:55:34.420 --> 00:55:38.710
What disgusts me is not the record, but seeing myself pointed out, even in this case,

00:55:38.890 --> 00:55:41.930
and being once again the victim of the one who tries to harm me.

00:55:42.090 --> 00:55:44.570
We only try to clarify things.

00:55:45.030 --> 00:55:45.610
Record everything.

00:55:45.890 --> 00:55:59.840
I don't know what you're trying to do.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:02.960
that you have kidnapped Professor Galvan?

00:56:03.120 --> 00:56:06.200
I repeat, Inspector, you have no right to suspect me.

00:56:06.400 --> 00:56:09.980
If I were guilty, I would not have asked the Saint for your help in my defense.

00:56:10.380 --> 00:56:11.340
The Saint?

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:01.260
I can't register anything, Inspector.

00:57:02.060 --> 00:57:03.940
Keep your irony, Dr. Carroll.

00:57:05.250 --> 00:57:06.510
I'm doing my duty.

00:57:07.150 --> 00:57:09.590
Therefore, you should know that we will have to close your museum.

00:57:09.750 --> 00:57:10.230
Temporarily.

00:57:10.490 --> 00:57:11.360
I have the judge's order.

00:57:12.980 --> 00:57:14.040
Closed? Why?

00:57:15.480 --> 00:57:17.220
It's in your benefit, Doctor.

00:57:17.540 --> 00:57:20.430
Don't you say you're afraid they'll attack you or your establishment?

00:57:20.930 --> 00:57:23.160
It will be better if you remain closed for a few days.

00:57:23.340 --> 00:57:24.730
For your own safety.

00:57:25.480 --> 00:57:25.980
Good afternoon.

00:57:26.510 --> 00:57:26.930
Good afternoon.

00:57:33.580 --> 00:57:34.380
I've already told the inspector.

00:57:34.740 --> 00:57:38.070
You'll have to refrain from his services for some time.

00:57:39.330 --> 00:57:40.230
This will help you.

00:57:40.640 --> 00:57:42.860
I'll let you know when I reopen the museum.

00:58:05.468 --> 00:58:07.468
You

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:32.140
Do you remember that I asked for a picture of Dr. Carol?

00:58:32.650 --> 00:58:34.700
Yes, I remember.

00:58:35.060 --> 00:58:36.540
I just received it.

00:58:38.040 --> 00:58:40.720
The portrait was taken when Carol arrived in the United States.

00:58:41.620 --> 00:58:43.280
Almost 20 years ago.

00:58:43.420 --> 00:58:46.360
And the funny thing is that it is exactly the same as now.

00:58:46.520 --> 00:58:48.420
As if not a single day had passed.

00:58:48.940 --> 00:58:49.740
That news is interesting.

00:58:50.560 --> 00:58:55.240
It confirms the suspicion that recently began to worry me.

00:58:56.590 --> 00:58:59.770
I thought that the fact that Dr. Carol called me to make me...

00:59:00.410 --> 00:59:03.000
is no guarantee of his innocence.

00:59:03.440 --> 00:59:08.310
It is possible that he did it so that knowing that I defend his cause,

00:59:08.550 --> 00:59:10.100
no one suspects him.

00:59:11.600 --> 00:59:14.180
Perhaps the knife that was thrown at him in my presence

00:59:14.180 --> 00:59:16.400
was a troop that he himself prepared.

00:59:16.660 --> 00:59:27.380
Ricardo, someone was spying on me from Professor Galvan's office

00:59:27.380 --> 00:59:28.930
and he heard what I told him.

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:33.400
I don't know who he is, but I need a definitive proof to accuse him.

00:59:33.520 --> 00:59:36.690
And I think I've found him in Susana's camera negatives.

00:59:37.730 --> 00:59:40.460
As soon as I get a copy, I'll be able to confirm it.

00:59:41.010 --> 00:59:43.380
Now I have to go fight. I'll talk to you later.

01:00:42.540 --> 01:00:43.790
The great...

01:02:01.180 --> 01:02:01.440
Thank you.

01:02:30.280 --> 01:02:30.520
Thank you.

01:06:48.010 --> 01:06:49.470
Santo has discovered too much.

01:06:49.800 --> 01:06:50.760
Now he's in his study.

01:06:50.980 --> 01:06:51.660
He's being taken in.

01:06:51.760 --> 01:06:53.900
And wherever they find him, they'll kill him.

01:06:54.180 --> 01:06:55.060
He's a dangerous man.

01:06:56.630 --> 01:06:57.130
One moment.

01:06:57.370 --> 01:06:59.410
Go through the secret door.

01:07:00.160 --> 01:07:01.120
The main one is closed.

01:07:01.680 --> 01:07:22.210
Don't kill me, just kill me once, I can't take it anymore.

01:07:23.760 --> 01:07:24.660
You're not going to die.

01:08:04.060 --> 01:08:10.360
I am transforming your blood little by little to provoke you long cataleptic states with the drug I have invented.

01:08:10.760 --> 01:08:15.300
When you have achieved it, you will be able to start your transformation.

01:08:16.230 --> 01:08:17.090
What are you talking about?

01:08:17.770 --> 01:08:21.980
About something I already explained to you once, about the Panther Woman.

01:08:22.640 --> 01:08:23.380
No, no.

01:08:24.200 --> 01:08:27.470
I will live in the museum as my masterpiece.

01:08:28.740 --> 01:08:29.200
No.

01:08:30.350 --> 01:08:30.770
I want to die.

01:08:31.070 --> 01:08:34.030
To die? That would be too easy.

01:08:34.390 --> 01:08:37.060
You have to pay for your crime of being beautiful.

01:10:34.730 --> 01:10:35.010
Yaw!

01:11:00.920 --> 01:11:01.360
Yeah.

01:11:58.120 --> 01:11:59.360
Are you sure he's dead?

01:12:01.440 --> 01:12:08.040
Good, good. I just need the journalist and his girlfriend, who should also know something.

01:12:35.500 --> 01:12:36.300
Yes, Santo?

01:12:40.010 --> 01:12:43.460
I can't speak loudly. Maybe they're listening to me.

01:12:43.940 --> 01:12:47.000
But I have the final evidence against Dr. Carol.

01:12:47.890 --> 01:12:50.590
Come immediately to Professor Galvan's house.

01:12:51.300 --> 01:12:55.380
Yes, Professor Galvan's house. Don't tell anyone and try not to be seen.

01:12:56.390 --> 01:12:59.520
But tell me, Santo, what evidence do you have?

01:13:00.510 --> 01:13:03.460
Now I can't. Come immediately, I need you here.

01:13:25.760 --> 01:13:29.340
Say hello, my love. Have you heard any news?

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:31.380
I think everything will be clear soon.

01:13:31.890 --> 01:13:34.530
Santo just called me to Professor Galván's house.

01:13:34.530 --> 01:13:36.380
Oh, be very careful, Ricardo.

01:13:36.640 --> 01:13:37.780
Something could happen to you.

01:13:37.920 --> 01:13:39.590
No, don't worry.

01:13:41.370 --> 01:13:42.870
There's something that seems strange to me.

01:13:43.360 --> 01:13:44.960
And I've already thought about taking my precautions.

01:13:46.570 --> 01:13:47.730
It's 11 and 10.

01:13:47.930 --> 01:13:50.780
If I haven't called you back before 12 o'clock,

01:13:50.780 --> 01:13:53.320
call the police and tell them where I am.

01:13:54.480 --> 01:13:56.850
Okay, see you later, Linda.

01:14:42.120 --> 01:14:42.420
She's dead.

01:15:12.800 --> 01:15:15.370
I thank you very much. It was necessary to deceive him.

01:15:15.430 --> 01:15:18.330
Anyway, he will have to rest for a few days.

01:15:19.080 --> 01:15:20.920
The wound has been deep.

01:15:21.620 --> 01:15:23.570
I have a mission to fulfill, doctor.

01:15:36.810 --> 01:15:37.150
Hands up.

01:15:37.410 --> 01:15:40.980
Come in, friend.

01:15:41.480 --> 01:15:42.820
Tell me, where is Susana?

01:15:42.960 --> 01:15:44.610
What are you talking about?

01:15:45.460 --> 01:15:47.340
Nothing is going to help you to simulate her innocence.

01:15:48.220 --> 01:15:50.480
You see that it was not worth simulating the voice of the saint.

01:15:53.230 --> 01:15:54.410
So you don't believe me?

01:15:54.630 --> 01:15:57.630
No, because I had to speak in a low voice.

01:15:58.200 --> 01:15:59.420
Who was going to hear it from here?

01:16:00.890 --> 01:16:04.850
My suspicions were confirmed when I found out that Santo's car was not on the street.

01:16:05.050 --> 01:16:08.580
I would say that he has finally defeated me.

01:16:09.840 --> 01:16:12.180
But I would like to know what his victory is.

01:16:12.440 --> 01:16:16.000
He already has me in his hands, but what is he going to accuse me of?

01:16:16.020 --> 01:16:18.030
Does he have any evidence against me?

01:16:18.290 --> 01:16:21.140
Has he found any of the victims who could blame me?

01:16:21.360 --> 01:16:22.120
Don't take one more step!

01:16:23.670 --> 01:16:24.970
Better let go of the gun.

01:16:25.290 --> 01:16:27.160
It won't do you any good.

01:16:30.860 --> 01:16:31.280
Let him go.

01:16:32.090 --> 01:16:34.820
I'm not giving up, damn it.

01:16:35.670 --> 01:16:36.830
The last move is left.

01:16:58.480 --> 01:16:58.700
Police chief?

01:18:00.380 --> 01:18:01.480
What does she have to do with it? Why has she brought it?

01:18:01.860 --> 01:18:05.060
Because she has also found out things that she should not have known.

01:18:07.170 --> 01:18:09.590
Besides, I didn't want to miss this show.

01:18:10.070 --> 01:18:16.300
My sensational discovery that would amaze medical science if it could see it.

01:18:16.460 --> 01:18:23.540
The transformation of the human being into one of its most despicable and depraved creatures.

01:18:24.020 --> 01:18:26.990
Because not all the figures in my museum are made of wax.

01:18:27.790 --> 01:18:29.770
Some of them are human beings.

01:18:30.380 --> 01:18:33.780
living monsters that I wake up and make sleep to my whim.

01:18:34.260 --> 01:18:41.520
The time has finally come, Susana.

01:18:41.660 --> 01:18:45.580
Soon your damn beauty will cease to exist.

01:18:45.580 --> 01:18:49.110
You will only be an instrument of my will.

01:18:50.430 --> 01:18:51.310
Heat the wax!

01:19:10.720 --> 01:19:11.940
Don't think he's going to put an end to his madness.

01:19:12.600 --> 01:19:13.960
Santo will avenge us!

01:19:15.440 --> 01:19:16.520
Santo is dead.

01:19:17.200 --> 01:19:27.930
When the wax begins to boil,

01:19:28.290 --> 01:19:29.800
it will advance to...

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:32.160
the refractory crystal tubes.

01:19:32.160 --> 01:19:35.610
Through them, it will reach the alambics

01:19:35.610 --> 01:19:37.730
where it will mix with the acids,

01:19:38.090 --> 01:19:41.690
thus forming the chemical substance

01:19:41.690 --> 01:19:46.250
that will transform the human skin into a moldable wound

01:19:46.250 --> 01:19:48.830
to initiate the metamorphosis.

01:20:00.380 --> 01:20:03.540
Here you will receive the burning wax that will embrace your flesh.

01:20:03.780 --> 01:20:07.520
You will feel the pain of death, but you will not die,

01:20:07.900 --> 01:20:10.810
because I have prepared your body to resist.

01:20:13.270 --> 01:20:13.810
Murderer!

01:20:13.850 --> 01:20:19.180
I want you to know the suffering.

01:20:19.800 --> 01:20:24.610
You do not know, you cannot understand the torture

01:20:24.610 --> 01:20:28.430
of those long interrogations in the concentration camp of Dachau.

01:20:30.030 --> 01:20:33.110
Where can the human mind reach in its sadism?

01:20:33.170 --> 01:20:37.450
In the search for the ways to torture a man.

01:20:37.670 --> 01:20:43.310
Everything they did to me, how they destroyed me.

01:20:45.180 --> 01:20:46.780
We suffered the war.

01:20:46.980 --> 01:20:50.410
A cruel, merciless, inhuman war.

01:20:50.490 --> 01:20:53.430
A war of which you have only heard of,

01:20:53.710 --> 01:20:55.910
but without feeling it in your own flesh.

01:20:56.130 --> 01:20:59.850
I have suffered to the limit.

01:21:01.470 --> 01:21:03.610
to feel that my veins wanted to burst.

01:21:04.090 --> 01:21:07.940
And my only comfort is to recreate myself

01:21:07.940 --> 01:21:09.040
seeing the pain of others.

01:21:09.480 --> 01:21:11.500
That's why I don't want to kill them yet.

01:21:11.840 --> 01:21:15.020
I want to enjoy seeing around me

01:21:15.020 --> 01:21:16.940
the anguish, the despair.

01:21:18.020 --> 01:21:25.490
It's a false fear, isn't it?

01:21:25.530 --> 01:21:29.800
The fear I felt during...

01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:36.330
to my executioners, that same fear I want others to feel, all the other beings of the earth.

01:21:36.610 --> 01:21:42.920
The human being is a monster, as those who tortured me demonstrated.

01:21:42.940 --> 01:21:48.620
So, what not to demonstrate in his face what his soul is?

01:21:48.640 --> 01:21:53.270
That is why I want to create a world of physically deformed beings,

01:21:53.370 --> 01:21:59.620
of beings in whose face you can see the monster of the apocalypse, the hunger, the plague.

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:00.880
of war and death!

01:31:00.540 --> 01:31:04.370
There's a secret lab down there, the strange world of Dr. Carroll.

01:31:04.550 --> 01:31:05.230
And him?

01:31:05.450 --> 01:31:08.590
He died at his own hands, in the hell he invented.

01:31:09.310 --> 01:31:11.700
Thank you, Santo. We owe you our lives.

01:31:12.080 --> 01:31:13.720
You're an admirable man.

01:31:14.330 --> 01:31:16.850
I'm nothing more than a faithful servant of justice and good.
